{"answerArea":{"calculator":true,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Set $y=0$ to find the $x$-intercepts.\n\n$0=2(x+1)(x-1)$\n\nThis equation is true when $x={-1}$ and $x={1}$.\n\nOur parabola intersects the $x$-axis at the points $(-1,0)$ and $(1,0)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The vertex lies on the parabola's axis of symmetry, which is exactly between the two $x$-intercepts. Averaging the intercepts, we get:\n\n$\\begin{align}\nx\u0026=\\dfrac{{-1}+{1}}{2} \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\dfrac{0}{2} \\\\\\\\\n\u0026=0\n\\end{align}$\n\n","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Now we plug $x=0$ into the equation to find the $y$-coordinate of the vertex:\n\n$\\begin{align}\ny\u0026=2(0+1)(0-1)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=2\\cdot (1)(-1)\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=-2\n\\end{align}$\n\nThe vertex of the parabola is at $(0,-2)$, and two other points on the parabola are $(-1,0)$ and $(1,0)$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The answer:\n\n[[☃ grapher 7]]","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{"grapher 7":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"availableTypes":["quadratic"],"correct":{"coords":[[0,-2],[1,0]],"type":"quadratic"},"graph":{"backgroundImage":{"url":null},"editableSettings":["graph","snap","image"],"gridStep":[1,1],"labels":["x","y"],"markings":"graph","range":[[-10,10],[-10,10]],"rulerLabel":"","rulerTicks":10,"showProtractor":false,"showRuler":false,"snapStep":[1,1],"step":[1,1],"valid":true}},"static":true,"type":"grapher","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Graph the equation.**\n\n$y=2(x+1)(x-1)$\n\n[[☃ grapher 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"grapher 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"availableTypes":["quadratic"],"correct":{"coords":[[0,-2],[1,0]],"type":"quadratic"},"graph":{"backgroundImage":{"url":null},"editableSettings":["graph","snap","image"],"gridStep":[1,1],"labels":["x","y"],"markings":"graph","range":[[-10,10],[-10,10]],"rulerLabel":"","rulerTicks":10,"showProtractor":false,"showRuler":false,"snapStep":[1,1],"step":[1,1],"valid":true}},"static":false,"type":"grapher","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}}}}}
